Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
The superfluid boson singlet state of the gauge-covariant spinor field on the \
3+1 manifold of the Lorentz super-loop\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"4aa68fd3-266d-4066-92e0-39061fe9ada3"],

Cell["\<\
PROJECT spacetimes, folder Revision_HS_CJT_and_Kohn-Sham. The notebook \
superfluid.nb, prepared for Patrick Lee Nash, Ph.D.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"7335bd0b-b7ca-4d90-b5e0-d75e574b3932"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook is the Wolfram Language companion of the manuscript of the \
solution in the same folder, written so that a first-year graduate student in \
physics can follow every step. It states the problem and the conventions, \
defines every object that a computation needs, writes out the equations that \
can be executed, and executes them: the algebra of the manifold M31 and of \
the Lorentz super-loop, the spinor field and the gauge group GEE with its \
covariant derivatives, the field equations and their analytic solutions, the \
condensation of the spinor field into the superfluid boson singlet state by \
the methods of Hubbard and Stratonovich (HS), of Kohn and Sham (KS) and of \
Cornwall, Jackiw and Tomboulis (CJT), the effective Lagrangians and the \
Mexican hat, the breaking of the symmetry and the masses of the gauge bosons, \
the surviving symmetry with its massless photon, and the dynamics. Every time \
integration in this notebook is done by the method IDA of the function ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; no fixed-step integrator (such as the fourth-order Runge-Kutta method) is \
used anywhere."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c95a324d-d140-49be-9a76-298bdc08dc3b"],

Cell["\<\
How to use it. Open the notebook in Wolfram (version 15 or later; it was \
evaluated with Wolfram 15.0.1) and choose Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. The \
cells are evaluated in order. Nothing outside this notebook is read: every \
definition and every program is inside it. Every check prints one line that \
begins with PASS or FAIL, and the last chapter lists all checks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"944059d6-9fea-4e3e-824a-836a7e1f9626"],

Cell["\<\
How to read it. A text cell explains, in words and formulas, what the next \
input cell does and why. Inside the code, comments (* like this *) explain \
each step, and every symbol of the code that stands for an object of the \
physics has a comment with its printed name and its meaning the first time it \
is defined. A symbol of the printed text with the suffix LL is taken \
unchanged from the earlier work of the project on the super-loop; a symbol \
with the suffix SF is introduced by this solution.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d886c432-c6c1-437c-84e7-8bb6fc39f072"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The checks and their counterparts. Every computation of this notebook is \
also done by a program in Rust and by a program in Python, in the folders ",
 StyleBox["rust/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of the folder of the solution; users without a Wolfram license can follow \
the solution with those programs. Every check of this notebook carries the \
identifier of the same check in the Rust program with the prefix W (for \
example WA-3 is the check A-3 of the Rust program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and of the Python program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "), and the line that it prints names both counterparts. The notebook \
computes its values itself, by methods of the Wolfram Language (exact \
arithmetic where the Rust program computes in floating point, symbolic \
derivatives where it differentiates automatically, the solvers of the Wolfram \
Language where it uses its own); the numbers agree with those of the two \
programs within the tolerances stated in each check."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"33cc1d21-4d23-428c-b28e-b8d08e20a440"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0. The register of the checks", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"f1eb0b78-1907-40cf-ba3c-2a69bdd67e3f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines the functions that record and print a check. ",
 StyleBox["check[id, text, dev, tol, rust, python]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a numerical check: it passes when the measured deviation ",
 StyleBox["dev",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is at most the tolerance ",
 StyleBox["tol",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; ",
 StyleBox["rust",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " are the identifiers of the same check in the Rust and in the Python \
program. ",
 StyleBox["checkTrue[id, text, ok, detail, rust, python]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a check that is decided by facts (a count, an exact identity), \
with a short ",
 StyleBox["detail",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". Both append an association to the list ",
 StyleBox["SFNB`Test`$Results",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", the register of all checks of this notebook, and print one line. The \
function ",
 StyleBox["sci",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " writes a number with four significant digits in the form ",
 StyleBox["2.857e-8",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", as the reports of the Rust and the Python programs do."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a497985f-bb8d-4783-853a-288af15851cd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "register", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "checks", " ", "of", " ",
      "this", " ", 
     RowBox[{"notebook", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"one", " ", "association", " ", "per", " ", "check"}]}]}], ",", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"in", " ", "the", " ", "order", " ", "of", " ", "evaluation"}]}], 
   " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sci", "[", "x", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "number", " ", "x", " ", "with", " ", "four", " ", 
       "significant", " ", "digits"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "written", " ", "as", " ", "mantissa", " ", "e", " ", "exponent", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"for", " ", "example", " ", "2.857", "e"}], "-", "8"}], 
       ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sci", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"y", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "e", ",", " ", "m"}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"y", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<0\>\"", ",", " ", "Module"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "y", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"y", "/", 
            RowBox[{"10.", "^", "e"}]}], ",", " ", "0.001"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m", "]"}], " ", ">=", " ", "10"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"m", "/", "10"}]}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"e", " ", "+", " ", "1"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
          RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
           RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<>", 
         " ", "\"\<e\>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "e", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"called", " ", "after", " ", "every", " ", "check"}]}], ";", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"it", " ", "does", " ", "nothing", " ", "here", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
       "a", " ", "dry", " ", "run", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "code", " ", 
        "without", " ", "the", " ", "front", " ", "end", "\n", "   ", "uses", 
        " ", "it", " ", "to", " ", "print", " ", "the", " ", "computing", " ",
         "time", " ", "of", " ", "each", " ", "check"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "Null"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "dev", ",", " ", "tol", ",", " ", 
        "rust", ",", " ", "python"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "numerical", " ", "check"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"passed", " ", "when", " ", "dev"}], " ", "<=", " ", "tol"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"check", "[", 
      RowBox[{"id_String", ",", " ", "text_String", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dev_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"tol_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", "rust_String", ",", " ", 
       "python_String"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"ok", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"N", "[", "dev", "]"}], " ", "<=", " ", "tol"}], "]"}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "id"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "ok"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "dev", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "tol", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<text\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "text"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<rust\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "rust"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<python\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "python"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "ok", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "id", ",", " ", "\"\<  deviation \>\"", ",", " ", 
          
          RowBox[{"sci", "[", "dev", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\< (tolerance \>\"", 
          ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"sci", "[", "tol", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<): \>\"", ",", " ",
           "text", ",", "\n", "     ", "\"\<   [the same check: Rust \>\"", ",",
           " ", "rust", ",", " ", "\"\<, Python \>\"", ",", " ", "python", ",",
           " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "ok"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkTrue", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "ok", ",", " ", "detail", ",", " ", 
        "rust", ",", " ", "python"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "check", " ", "decided", " ", "by", " ", "facts"}]}], 
     ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"detail", " ", "states", " ", "them"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "id_String", ",", " ", "text_String", ",", " ", "ok_", ",", " ", 
       "detail_String", ",", " ", "rust_String", ",", " ", "python_String"}], 
      "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"pass", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "ok", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "id"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "pass"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<text\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{
             "text", " ", "<>", " ", "\"\< [\>\"", " ", "<>", " ", "detail", 
              " ", "<>", " ", "\"\<]\>\""}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<rust\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "rust"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<python\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "python"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "pass", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "id", ",", " ", "\"\<  \>\"", ",", " ", "text", ",",
           " ", "\"\< [\>\"", ",", " ", "detail", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<]   [the same check: Rust \>\"", ",", " ", "rust", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, Python \>\"", ",", " ", "python", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "pass"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"524ec625-f19d-4603-b135-91f5d929d5b5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part I. The manifold M31, the spinor field, GEE, the field equations and four \
analytic solutions\
\>", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"47f6ab56-4f5d-422c-b6fb-f7b83c81e55b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Part I treats items 1 to 5 of the problem (Sections 1 to 7 of the \
manuscript): the manifold M31 of the Lorentz super-loop, the spinor fields on \
it and the Dirac field, the gauge group GEE and its covariant derivatives, \
the Lagrangian with its field equations, and analytic solutions of four \
simple cases. Its checks are those of the Python program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", which repeats a part of the checks of the Rust program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; the random test values of this notebook come from the generator of the \
Wolfram Language with the seed 20261121, so they differ from those of the two \
programs, as theirs differ from each other."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"92ed1f8d-830c-436a-a69d-38b9e86c290f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["I.1 Conventions, units and the common objects", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fbfd8998-d6ca-4c27-ac13-3ae7279a9f35"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Units.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Planck's constant and the speed of light are 1; energies, masses and \
momenta are measured in units of the momentum cutoff ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b3917472-4fdb-464d-9b78-513623d50142"],
 ", lengths and times in units of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3c80380b-662e-4f5f-a599-7ea5c13c0352"],
 ". The mass of the spinor field is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f98ddd4-fa6d-4b3f-9352-6e6d4d631701"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0519e7b9-7e3a-46a8-bd9a-ee275dd1d5bc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Indices.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "24104fb6-e758-4683-bac5-5d5f0024889d"],
 " run over the four coordinates of M31 (0 is the time), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0d876332-08a6-4ebf-867a-d264432cda51"],
 " over the three space coordinates, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Iota]", ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Iota]", "\[Prime]"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Iota]", "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2579e76b-66ca-40b3-98b0-83bedcc1e999"],
 " over the three directions of isospin (an internal direction, not a \
direction in space), and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d89612d3-d551-41c9-aabc-b3b6cbe6d1f9"],
 " over the eight components of the spinor field. The letter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "030f7979-a827-41cb-a888-3cb88039d761"],
 " is always the imaginary unit. The Minkowski metric is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "af994285-18d2-4e35-9929-d735a3467bd4"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6b788b03-955b-481e-a292-15d7c6a12fa4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Matrices.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4721b767-6ebe-448b-b660-e5ba7d480d6c"],
 " is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8f2e0257-435e-4f09-a2fc-b3ac8d79c9f3"],
 " unit matrix and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "1", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "3", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c9949821-5c29-44c0-ac1c-81c682840290"],
 " are the Pauli matrices; acting on isospin they are written ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c8f045b9-5fc4-40ed-8cc2-bfe59d2258f3"],
 ". ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b1d203ec-c015-4460-b38c-639f8b260cab"],
 ". The Dirac matrices are those of the chiral basis, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e96f136a-19c8-445b-a0f8-01b9d1dd6c43"],
 " with the blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "88041d13-c99e-4315-b181-b9aafc5e8bc1"],
 " off the diagonal and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "347b9302-feaf-45ff-871e-0f54eacc43c4"],
 " with the blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36100d91-aff5-4984-a5ab-bed61a715f8f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2edc7a02-dfd3-428c-b2ab-34b48d9147af"],
 "; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["ch",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1", ",", "1"}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd9659fb-c9e2-4ea9-a591-df8795dce3d3"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f12e146f-74ad-4258-b5ee-b2cbe1a6f744"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f7d3c795-6c02-46cf-8d60-f9a14591fd5e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c80362cb-0dbb-40be-9ff9-d6927115499d"],
 ". The spinor field ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bfc5c56-3833-4885-9af6-6e08588caac7"],
 " has eight components: the Dirac index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "575837d6-dbaa-4375-93c0-5f87dd00d887"],
 " (four values) and the isospin index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "232caa2e-c87b-46f8-8c23-b7385bffc1e6"],
 " (up, down); a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4bc80017-550d-4c9d-9ca4-dea163666086"],
 " Dirac matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["A", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fba49979-4fd7-431e-b971-e172722406d4"],
 " acts on it as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04bb9ee7-2615-4bf5-8687-d41e6b733323"],
 " and an isospin matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48fc9f64-30bf-4249-bcd4-da3223d71fd2"],
 " as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "838c97c2-203e-4c03-afeb-6209f99b2292"],
 ". The isospin generators are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Iota]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "203847d6-22ae-48c4-bddc-f86c280ac224"],
 ", the matrices of the three spin-zero pair fields are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["K",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Iota]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["ch",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3a799ca7-d658-4090-8e7b-f21263424d0b"],
 ", and the free Dirac Hamiltonian at the momentum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9c98f47c-701d-4607-903e-1aabe662413b"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31aab4f8-9ead-443e-8fcc-bab3314f2ba0"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d005d8c2-9385-4da7-bb6a-0f8800d8fc28"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The author's conventions (the Standard Model).",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The covariant derivative of the Higgs doublet is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "+", 
      StyleBox["ig", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], "3",
       LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
        StyleBox["a", "TI"]], "2"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["a", "TI"]], "+", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["SM",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], ")"}], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cde0b3b1-857e-49ff-b1a3-2fa2e86eecbf"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f3bf2b98-15f2-45ea-9da3-23bc14e12088"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "+", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56e3b944-52ae-44d7-8f16-4c0fbebb6601"],
 "; the fields of definite mass are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "\[PlusMinus]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "1"], "\[MinusPlus]", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "2"]}], ")"}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "34a79501-dde9-4ee9-8392-f2c29e92ec26"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "3"], "-", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e09a0afd-2bd9-4c8e-b3af-0c08f4eefe49"],
 " and the photon ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "3"], "+", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ef2ac33f-84ef-48d2-b6a6-2567c0907943"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a2b461c4-6e11-4ead-88f3-09f374151b4e"],
 "; with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", 
      StyleBox["v", "TI"]}], ")"}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ab7b939f-90d3-41f2-a741-a166f55c6209"],
 " the masses are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["gv", "TI"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9d7c4588-af0d-4bdf-a090-c57b7ad47b0b"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"\[Prime]", "2"}]]}]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "da8e0cbf-51c8-4d62-a029-b7dadb9dbc09"],
 ", and the photon is massless. All GEE covariant derivatives of the solution \
use the same sign, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a8af826d-80f3-4761-8e18-eec5731a1506"],
 " in front of every coupling."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3d88ec6b-837d-4a8a-bf79-0e28ce96f120"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines these matrices, the bi-quaternions and bi-octonions \
of Section I.2, the Lorentz matrices, the spinor matrices and the operators \
of the Fock space of one point. They are the same objects as those of the \
Rust library ",
 StyleBox["sfcore",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and of the Python module ",
 StyleBox["sfcommon.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", written here with the functions of the Wolfram Language."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4636ff1b-f336-4379-a2ba-152e46fadae5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "mass", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "spinor", " ", "field"}], 
    ",", " ", "m_LL", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "in", " ", "units", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "cutoff", " ", 
      "Lambda_LL"}], " ", "=", " ", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"mLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "5"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       RowBox[{"sigma", "^", "LL_p"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "=", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2", ",",
          " ", "3"}], ")"}]}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "sigma_", "0", " ", "is", " ", "the", " ", "2", " ", "x", " ", "2", " ",
        "unit", " ", "matrix"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "1"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "2"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "3", " ", "the", " ", "Pauli", " ", "matrices"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sig", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sigbar", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       "sigma"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"bar_p", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sigma_", "0", " ", "and"}], " ", "-", "sigma_j"}]}]}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "blocks", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "Dirac", " ", 
      "matrices", " ", "below", " ", "the", " ", "diagonal"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sigbar", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"eLL", " ", "is", " ", "E_LL"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"i", " ", "sigma_", "2"}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"eLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "etaLL", " ", "is", " ", "the", " ", "Minkowski", " ", "metric", " ", 
      RowBox[{"eta", "^", "LL"}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"diag", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"etaLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"levi", "[", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "b", ",", " ", "c"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       "the", " ", "Levi"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"Civita", " ", "symbol", " ", 
       RowBox[{"epsilon", "^", "LL"}], " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "indices", 
       " ", "1"}]}], ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "3"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"levi", "[", 
      RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_", ",", " ", "c_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
