   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"F-5c\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"]\"\>"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "PASS ", "WF-5c", "  ", 
   "D1: the Lorentz-invariant bilinears of one point form a space of \
dimension 6; those invariant also under the Pauli-Guersey SU(2), dimension 0",
