  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1a4faa45-0df4-409d-95f4-0c5362d124f9"],
 " for a pairing term. The state is the ground state of the matrix of \
Bogoliubov and de Gennes at every momentum,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f08b40f3-98ef-4c0e-ac01-31d89bd45737"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["H",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
