Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["II.3 The recursion of the potential and the ground states", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"25b8c78e-03f3-4258-b649-5fefe6119828"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The task asks to change the potential until all three methods admit a \
superfluid. ",
 StyleBox["The effective couplings.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " For a uniform state whose normal self-energy is a Dirac mass and whose \
pair self-energy lies in the channel ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["K",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4a7ab61b-8efd-46ff-b2f6-3f9926519282"],
 ", every method acts through two numbers: the scalar coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9db63c48-ea0d-42a0-a61c-002f2c9dfd47"],
 " (the shift of the Dirac mass per unit scalar density) and the pair \
coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["P",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0e3825fe-c38a-408d-b0f5-0b68998228ee"],
 " (the pair self-energy per unit pair amplitude), computed by ",
 StyleBox["effCouplings",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " from the self-energy maps of the terms. The normal vacuum is unstable \
towards pairing when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["P",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["P",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["crit",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ">", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e1d2e23-8e2f-498c-b1e3-bcd206c70699"],
 ", with the critical pair coupling of AS3,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"59824463-af53-4dd6-85c7-9770d083b942"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["crit",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   FractionBox[
    SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"], 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}]}]], ",", "      ", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["dq", "TI"]}], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], "-", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["arsinh",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     FractionBox["1", 
      StyleBox["M", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "."}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"9eed4a8b-58a7-451b-bf8e-e2320ac8635d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The three potentials.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cb87995b-6f86-4271-ab03-2508e6688acd"],
 " (the author's: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c3086703-dba1-42be-b045-33efd4a5b3eb"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.8"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "870efdb1-6c57-4712-9f75-e0476851a115"],
 ", no pairing term) admits no superfluid in any method. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cf83dd40-fd81-417b-ab15-b7dd3c02d389"],
 " adds the pairing term with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "22.5"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4bd1b68c-8e00-487d-bbe0-bfceeadeac72"],
 ", the value of AS3: HS becomes superfluid, but in KS and CJT the exchange \
contraction of the pairing term acts in the scalar channel as an attraction, \
the scalar channel becomes unstable, and the ground state is a massive state. \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bfd4236f-644a-44da-a026-327ae503a387"],
 " keeps the form and the vector coupling and fixes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["S",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1b6e0cb6-70cb-4aaa-afc6-66762002e8c2"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c9d6570f-6bc8-4a33-afd1-2f41c382fdac"],
 " by two conditions on the CJT couplings: the scalar coupling of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f72f476-e493-44c2-93c1-10b6a32e5a85"],
 " (stable) and the pair coupling of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7714613d-3da6-4c8f-9999-8f4a96d8b6b6"],
 " (supercritical). The couplings are linear in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["S",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e89abd45-2c51-46bc-9a8a-5f579ff6f0d9"],
 ", so the conditions are two linear equations, which the next cell solves \
from the computed couplings; the solution is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "2.8"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
