relative), and the gap equation holds (largest |g^P I1/pi^2 - 1|; the sum of \
both)", "   [the same check: Rust ", "P3-T2 CJT", ", Python ", "YP3-T2 CJT", 
   "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
