  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0.98", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["c",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "753100ee-4112-4b77-8d4b-b9433b0833ea"],
 ", the radius of convergence at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0.98", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["c",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5b3b9f22-275e-4fe9-b01d-cceff2235987"],
 " (from the Dirac mass of the normal state computed by the notebook), the \
reduced temperature above which the order parameter lies inside the radius, \
and the residuals of the two forms at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["T", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d453586b-eea2-4c40-bef2-49b6f05990e2"],
 " and at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0.98", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["c",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9f577d67-38a0-45da-9730-83e54013ec15"],
 " (in per cent of the depth). The two cells of the figure after it show the \
order parameter and the radius against ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
